              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                Solar-control security film: heat rejection + UV block + impact resistance
              </li>
              <li>
