                <button class="of-ftype__faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What standards apply to blast mitigation film?<span class="of-ftype__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
                <div class="of-ftype__faq-a" hidden>ASTM F1642 is the airblast loading test method for glazing systems. GSA TS01 is the federal blast glazing performance classification. We specify film systems tested in the context of these standards and provide documentation for your compliance file. Performance depends on the full glazing system — film, glass, frame, and attachment.</div>
