              <div class="of-ftype__faq-item">
                <button class="of-ftype__faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What thickness do I need for delayed entry?<span class="of-ftype__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
                <div class="of-ftype__faq-a" hidden>Security film for delayed entry starts at 8 mil and goes up to 15 mil for high-risk applications. Thicker film generally provides more impact resistance, but the right choice depends on glass type, frame strength, attachment method, and threat level. We assess all factors during your site evaluation and recommend the optimal specification.</div>
