              <div class="of-ftype__faq-item">
                <button class="of-ftype__faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Does security film qualify for insurance reductions?<span class="of-ftype__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
                <div class="of-ftype__faq-a" hidden>Some commercial property insurers offer premium reductions for documented security upgrades. Security window film is a physical hardening measure that your broker may recognize. We provide written documentation of the film type, certification standards met, and installation date for your records.</div>
