                <p>You receive a written proposal specifying the exact film by manufacturer, SKU, and verified performance data — VLT, SHGC, UV block, and warranty terms. We include a full scope of work and schedule around your operations. Commercial buildings often need evening or weekend installation to avoid tenant disruption; we accommodate that.</p>
